      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DISPARAGE (7) scored well last start as odds-on favourite by 0.9 lengths at Shepparton in a handy 25.23 beating Deadly Force. Draws out wide but likes the trip. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Can continue the winning form. DOONGALLA MIMIC (2) missed the hat-trick last start when second and beaten 0.7 lengths (25.56) last time at Warrnambool. Form at this distance is sound. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Expected to feature again. SPARRING (1) has a strong record this trip with four wins and three placings from 12 starts. In the money last time at Bendigo (23.79) in a Special conditions G2, finishing a 1.1 lengths third. Can feature with the right run. PAW ZURI (8) was strongly fancied last time but ran below expectations when fifth (24.18), beaten 5 lengths.",
